Vendored into Zeus unchanged in behavior from the haru-pipe 0.1.0 package
(pipeline-bench/package/haru-pipe). It is the host-side audio path for
Haru-4B: WAV I/O, int16/f32 conversion, polyphase resampling to 24 kHz,
3200-sample framing, and the haru_mlx.native 48 kHz socket framing.

This crate contains no model weights and opens no network connection.
Synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures are generated tones, not recordings.
